otice 2026</h2>\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">NTA UGC NET June Examination 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/nta-ugc-net-june-2025/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online start Date : <b>29 April 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online Last Date : <b>24 May 2026 (Extended) 11:50 PM</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Pay Exam Fees Last Date :\u00a0<b>24 May 2026 11:50 PM</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Date :<strong>\u00a026-28 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>22-30 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Re-Exam Date : 09 \u2013 10 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>10 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card Available :\u00a0<b>17 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>16 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Declared Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>Will Be Updated Here Soon</b></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>NTA</strong><b>\u00a0</b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-colu